{"id":"66e7bdc463325f8b","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-strong.md","title":"Strong Cardinal","display":"df-strong — Strong Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-strong","aliases":["58-df-strong"],"display":"df-strong — Strong Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-strong"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-strong</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-strong — Strong Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1c58d8be3b47a5f9\" href=\"?note=1c58d8be3b47a5f9\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StrongCardinal}\">\\(\\operatorname{StrongCardinal}\\)</span> is the class-metatheoretic strong-cardinal predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c58d8be3b47a5f9\" href=\"?note=1c58d8be3b47a5f9\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Strong}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Strong}_S\\)</span> is the compatibility predicate defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strong}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Strong}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{StrongCardinal}(\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strong}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Strong}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{StrongCardinal}(\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The upstream predicate supplies the full quantification over ordinal bounds and ambient-class elementary embeddings; this file does not replace that interface with a set-structure embedding predicate.</li>\n<li>Strong cardinals have consistency strength above measurable cardinals and below supercompact cardinals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c58d8be3b47a5f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c58d8be3b47a5f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{StrongCardinal}$ is the class-metatheoretic strong-cardinal predicate from [[../batch07/58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StrongCardinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Strong}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strong}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Strong}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{StrongCardinal}(\\kappa)","display":true}],"bytes":973,"backlinks":[{"id":"35ea5f205fd10ba8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ee6155a32baa8cf5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Strong}_S$ (strong-cardinal predicate from [[../batch15/58-df-strong.md]])"},{"id":"1f93d12a38d07e25","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8bb4c1c6a1e5bb28","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b1b421c8b0b990ce","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Strong}_S(\\kappa)$（强基数谓词，见 [[../batch15/58-df-strong.md]]）"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-224","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-strong]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1239","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-strong.md|58-df-strong]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["1c58d8be3b47a5f9"]}